            "review_text": "sunshinie\nRach Gia, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nA Premium Dining Experience Worth Every Penny\nJul 2026 • Friends\nThe menu is unique and offers a great variety of dishes. While it's on the pricier side, the quality of the food and the excellent service make it well worth it. My favorites were the raw beef and the beef rib soup. Everything was incredibly fresh, with clean, delicate flavors. The beef was naturally sweet, tender, and incredibly juicy.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 20, 2026",
