            "review_title": "Review at Kyung Bok Gung Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nam Ng\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nGreat place for dinner with anyone\nJul 2017 • Business\nSo, it was our dinner with Mr. Boss. The whole team were seated in a private and cozy room with nice Korean-styled deco. Foods were tasty and fast-served. There are many dishes to try but you should not skip BBQ and a dish which included stir-fried vegetable with pig's guts (I forgot the name). They also offered Korean traditional rice wine named Makkoli which I highly recommend to mix with beer or soft drinks and drink with BBQ.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2017",
